contributors, under the Mozilla Public License, version 2.0 (MPL-2.0).

The exact corresponding Source Code Form used by official Hermes builds is
Reliquary commit 5e4d5b0ba1ff0b498bd025bbc87394e702f48b18. It is available at:

https://github.com/Lokee86/Reliquary/tree/5e4d5b0ba1ff0b498bd025bbc87394e702f48b18

A downloadable archive of that source is available at:

https://github.com/Lokee86/Reliquary/archive/5e4d5b0ba1ff0b498bd025bbc87394e702f48b18.tar.gz

